{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1007 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "93171e7c63271e8fc20214a40cd054a5340f0024c45f8304ab58f8e547b8e9ba" :edb/db-before-t 1006 :edb/db-after-t 1007 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534319 50 #inst "2026-10-11T19:07:54.303Z" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186169131 1078 #edb/ref 17592186169133 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186172130 1038 #edb/ref 17592186418479 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186172131 1038 #edb/ref 17592186418478 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186172378 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186172378 1071 "Evaluate the surface integral\n$∬_(S)4xydS$,\nwhere the parametric surface $S$ is defined by the equations\n$x = u, y = v, z = 6 - 3u - 2v$\nfor $0 \\le u \\le 2$ and $0 \\le v \\le 3$." 13194139534319 17592186045417 false] [17592186172378 1071 "Evaluate the surface integral \n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}4xy\\,\\text{d}S,\n$$\n\nwhere the parametric surface $S$ is defined by the equations\n\n$$\nx=u,\\,y=v,\\,z=6-3u-2v\n$$\n\nfor $0\\le u\\le 2$ and $0\\le v\\le 3.$" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186172378 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nIn vector form, our surface has the equation \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨u,\\,v,\\,6-3u-2v⟩.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(6-3u-2v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,-3⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(6-3u-2v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}0 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,2,\\,1⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨3,\\,2,\\,1⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+4+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{14}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =4xy\\,{|}_{x=u\\,y=v\\,z=6-3u-2v} \\\\  & =4uv\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if we denote \n\n$$\nD={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 2,\\,0\\le v\\le 3},\n$$\n\nour surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}4xy\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,4uv\\sqrt{14}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{14}{∬}_{D}\\,4uv\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{14}{\\int }_{0}^{2}2u\\,\\text{d}u\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{3}2v\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\sqrt{14}\\cdot [{u}^{2}]_{0}^{2}\\cdot [{v}^{2}]_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{14}\\cdot 4\\cdot 9 \\\\  & =36\\sqrt{14}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418466 1080 "(-uv-v)\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418466 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418466 1083 #uuid "059c12fe-eab5-50d3-812e-daede28e5fce" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418467 1080 "12\\sqrt{10}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418467 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418467 1083 #uuid "10989bff-b98e-51af-bb4a-b28350a226e5" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418468 1080 "8\\sqrt{10}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418468 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418468 1083 #uuid "1687e4a9-1caf-5ff9-a03a-04a61daf8637" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418469 1080 "16\\sqrt{10}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418469 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418469 1083 #uuid "3d279b80-6077-585e-b090-d7cf3aa7efe0" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418470 1080 "14\\sqrt{10}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418470 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418470 1083 #uuid "60f276b3-36f3-5fbe-9d10-b5fec8b429a0" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418471 1080 "(-u{v}^{2}+v)\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418471 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418471 1083 #uuid "a69adeb6-2c36-5a75-b29d-f701876ba59a" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418472 1080 "20\\sqrt{10}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418472 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418472 1083 #uuid "b1865271-a8a9-5f44-b938-a958ba7e5f06" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418473 1080 "(u{v}^{2}-{v}^{2})\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418473 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418473 1083 #uuid "cbbd9a36-5d62-5a45-a0b6-211a1e349cc3" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418474 1080 "(-u{v}^{2}-v)\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418474 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418474 1083 #uuid "ded9ba33-54e3-5794-92a9-b6db153210e8" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418475 1080 "(-u{v}^{2}+{v}^{2})\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418475 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418475 1083 #uuid "e264331f-dc93-54c6-bb93-c8cd29731c14" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418467 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418468 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418469 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418470 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418472 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1077 "selection" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1078 #edb/ref 17592186418469 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418476 1079 #uuid "0ec0f1fd-a976-5791-b23e-66968bb1089c" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418466 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418471 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418473 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418474 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418475 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1077 "selection" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1078 #edb/ref 17592186418474 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418477 1079 #uuid "de80caed-f292-5fbc-ae6d-5bf6abf46eda" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418478 1068 #edb/ref 17592186418476 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418478 1069 "q-161185" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418478 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418478 1071 "Evaluate the surface integral \n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}(xy+xz)\\,\\text{d}S,\n$$\n\nwhere the parametric surface $S$ is defined by \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨u,\\,2v,\\,6v⟩\n$$\n\n \nover the domain $D={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 2}.$\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that $‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=2\\sqrt{10}.$*" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418478 1072 #uuid "d41258e7-4727-5661-9adb-26ceb25d76d0" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418478 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nNotice that we are told that the norm of the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=2\\sqrt{10}.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(xy+xz)\\,{|}_{x=u\\,y=2v\\,z=6v} \\\\  & =(u)(2v)+(u)(6v) \\\\  & =8uv\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,8uv\\cdot 2\\sqrt{10}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =16\\sqrt{10}{∬}_{D}\\,uv\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =16\\sqrt{10}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}uv\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & =16\\sqrt{10}({\\int }_{0}^{1}u\\,\\text{d}u)({\\int }_{0}^{2}v\\,\\text{d}v) \\\\  & =16\\sqrt{10}\\cdot {[\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{1}\\cdot {[\\frac{{v}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =16\\sqrt{10}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =16\\sqrt{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418479 1068 #edb/ref 17592186418477 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418479 1069 "q-161135" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418479 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418479 1071 "$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nConsider the surface integral of the function \n$f(x,y,z)=xz+y$ \nover the parametric surface \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨u,\\,-v,\\,-{v}^{2}⟩\n$$\n\nfor $(u,v)\\in D⊆{R}^{2}.$ What is the missing expression?\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that $‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}.$*" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418479 1072 #uuid "e6c3f387-d028-56cc-8550-337dfde31023" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true] [17592186418479 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nNotice that we are told that the norm of the fundamental vector product for our surface is\n\n$$\n‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(xz+y)\\,{|}_{x=u\\,y=-v\\,z={v}^{2}} \\\\  & =u\\cdot (-{v}^{2})+(-v) \\\\  & =-u{v}^{2}-v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(-u{v}^{2}-v)\\sqrt{1+4{v}^{2}}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534319 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-059c12fe-eab5-50d3-812e-daede28e5fce" 17592186418466 "answer-10989bff-b98e-51af-bb4a-b28350a226e5" 17592186418467 "answer-1687e4a9-1caf-5ff9-a03a-04a61daf8637" 17592186418468 "answer-3d279b80-6077-585e-b090-d7cf3aa7efe0" 17592186418469 "answer-60f276b3-36f3-5fbe-9d10-b5fec8b429a0" 17592186418470 "answer-a69adeb6-2c36-5a75-b29d-f701876ba59a" 17592186418471 "answer-b1865271-a8a9-5f44-b938-a958ba7e5f06" 17592186418472 "answer-cbbd9a36-5d62-5a45-a0b6-211a1e349cc3" 17592186418473 "answer-ded9ba33-54e3-5794-92a9-b6db153210e8" 17592186418474 "answer-e264331f-dc93-54c6-bb93-c8cd29731c14" 17592186418475 "answer-field-0ec0f1fd-a976-5791-b23e-66968bb1089c" 17592186418476 "answer-field-de80caed-f292-5fbc-ae6d-5bf6abf46eda" 17592186418477 "question-d41258e7-4727-5661-9adb-26ceb25d76d0" 17592186418478 "question-e6c3f387-d028-56cc-8550-337dfde31023" 17592186418479}}
